#: debian-bookworm opensuse-leap-16-0
msgid "/etc/modprobe\\&.d/*\\&.conf"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm opensuse-leap-16-0
msgid ""
"Because the B<modprobe> command can add or remove more than one module, due "
